### Get All Publications
GET http://localhost:8080/api/publications

### Get Publication by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/publications/1

### Search by Artist - Beatles
GET http://localhost:8080/api/publications/search/artist?name=Beatles

### Search by Genre - Rock
GET http://localhost:8080/api/publications/search/genre?name=Rock

